Package: run-ai
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: Hosting od Váška AI Platform <ai@hostingodvaska.cz>
Depends: ca-certificates, curl, tmux, openssh-client, rsync, bubblewrap
Homepage: https://ai.hostingodvaska.cz/
Description: provider-neutral terminal AI session runner
 run-ai selects and resumes supported AI terminal sessions through one
 provider-neutral command. This package contains only the user-facing CLI;
 privileged brokers and system services are intentionally separate.
